  "briefMd": "# Advanced · Retrieve + Rerank\n\nThe gold document often sits outside a narrow candidate window. Choose a reranker **and** a window wide enough to reach it.\n\nYou control the **reranker** (`none` / `title-boost` / `mmr`), **rerankTopN** (the candidate window) and an optional **query rewrite prompt**. The first stage is a plain keyword count over whole documents, so keyword-stuffed noise documents often outrank the right policy. The rewrite prompt costs one model call per question; the rewritten query is not used for ranking yet.\n\n**Gates:** nDCG@5 improves by at least 0.25, context tokens ≤ 700, ≤ 1 model call per question.\n",
  "submissionSchema": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "required": [
      "reranker",
      "rerankTopN"
    ],
    "properties": {
      "reranker": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "none",
          "title-boost",
          "mmr"
        ],
        "default": "none"
      },
      "rerankTopN": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 5,
        "maximum": 50,
        "default": 20
      },
      "queryRewritePrompt": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": ""
      }
    }
  },
  "thresholds": {
    "ndcg_improvement": 0.25,
    "context_tokens": 700,
    "model_calls_per_question": 1
  },
  "budget": {
    "max_model_calls": 50,
    "max_tokens": 80000,
    "max_cost_eur": 0.2,
    "wall_clock_s": 180
  },
  "gates": [
